Output docs/vhs/out/01-create-folder-and-request.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export SENDITO_KEYCHAIN=memory && cd /tmp/sendito-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "sendito" Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "N" Sleep 500ms Type "Payments" Sleep 300ms Tab Left Sleep 300ms Enter Sleep 800ms
Type "n" Sleep 500ms Type "charge card" Enter Sleep 800ms
Type "{{base_url}}/status/201" Sleep 500ms Ctrl+S Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+Q
